  "title": [
    "[The Graveyard Temporalis]"
  ],
  "description": [
    "A grotesquely twisted tree dominates this section of the graveyard, with bare, knotted limbs reaching upward, while unnatural nodule-ridden roots have broken the ground from beneath.  The roots have ensnared grave markers, encircling them near the bases, twining higher as if with the intention of dragging them beneath the earth.  A stone statue dwells under the tree, its visage lost to the wild roots entangling it."
  ],
